    "name": "The Shadow Beneath",
    "steam_appid": 3389620,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/216132e2a330a363f38f6522d5e10d58.poster.avif?t=1754583205\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/216132e2a330a363f38f6522d5e10d58.webm?t=1754583205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/216132e2a330a363f38f6522d5e10d58.mp4?t=1754583205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Battle relentless hordes of demons in a world consumed by darkness. Master devastating combos, forge powerful builds and descend into the shadows to reclaim what was stolen from mankind in this fast-paced Action Roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/573ae085ba57546b7a595339ed05e8b2.avif?t=1754583205\" data-has-big width=800 height=482 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/763d9c455f2b75c4fec3c4641fab70ee.avif?t=1754583205\" width=429 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Amon, the half-demon savior, on a brutal journey to slay the demon lord Apophis.</strong><br>Dive into the cursed pyramids and fight your way through ancient dungeons crawling with demonic horrors. Every room is a test of your reflexes, every enemy a threat. Survive traps, crush monsters, and rise through the depths - or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/fbedcbdc30ef48842628eaac78506603.poster.avif?t=1754583205\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/fbedcbdc30ef48842628eaac78506603.webm?t=1754583205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/fbedcbdc30ef48842628eaac78506603.mp4?t=1754583205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/62b557cfae7569a129ecaae3aea4d66f.avif?t=1754583205\" width=352 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No two runs play the same.</strong><br>Pick up a wild arsenal of active skills and passive upgrades - then create deadly combos on the fly. Will you be a glass cannon dashing into chaos, or a master of control who kites enemies into traps?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/90fd8b6ad55a087e0903f88fe2021e71.poster.avif?t=1754583205\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/90fd8b6ad55a087e0903f88fe2021e71.webm?t=1754583205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/90fd8b6ad55a087e0903f88fe2021e71.mp4?t=1754583205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/975ad4390ef4af4850e66e793544251d.avif?t=1754583205\" width=342 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This isn\u2019t just another auto-attacker. Your aim, timing and movement matters.</strong>  <br>Dodge through waves of enemies, chain skills with perfect precision and turn tight fights into stylish victories. The deeper you go, the faster and meaner everything gets - and only the most skilled make it to the end.<strong>  </strong>  <br>If you love games that reward fast thinking and tighter execution, you\u2019ll feel right at home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/259f59851f1a42f0dddc3b0aed33d616.poster.avif?t=1754583205\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/259f59851f1a42f0dddc3b0aed33d616.webm?t=1754583205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/259f59851f1a42f0dddc3b0aed33d616.mp4?t=1754583205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/fcb370cd5c15715249eb46f81ad9e6c5.avif?t=1754583205\" width=342 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every room is built with intention!</strong><br>We've designed more than 40 unique room layouts packed with traps, enemy ambushes and unexpected challenges. On each run, you'll face a fresh mix of these handcrafted encounters, keeping you on your toes without sacrificing flow or balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/2778bbf4fe17ea85ed0e34a9e8025019.poster.avif?t=1754583205\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/2778bbf4fe17ea85ed0e34a9e8025019.webm?t=1754583205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/2778bbf4fe17ea85ed0e34a9e8025019.mp4?t=1754583205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/216132e2a330a363f38f6522d5e10d58.poster.avif?t=1754583205\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/216132e2a330a363f38f6522d5e10d58.webm?t=1754583205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/216132e2a330a363f38f6522d5e10d58.mp4?t=1754583205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Battle relentless hordes of demons in a world consumed by darkness. Master devastating combos, forge powerful builds and descend into the shadows to reclaim what was stolen from mankind in this fast-paced Action Roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/573ae085ba57546b7a595339ed05e8b2.avif?t=1754583205\" data-has-big width=800 height=482 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/763d9c455f2b75c4fec3c4641fab70ee.avif?t=1754583205\" width=429 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Amon, the half-demon savior, on a brutal journey to slay the demon lord Apophis.</strong><br>Dive into the cursed pyramids and fight your way through ancient dungeons crawling with demonic horrors. Every room is a test of your reflexes, every enemy a threat. Survive traps, crush monsters, and rise through the depths - or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/fbedcbdc30ef48842628eaac78506603.poster.avif?t=1754583205\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/fbedcbdc30ef48842628eaac78506603.webm?t=1754583205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/fbedcbdc30ef48842628eaac78506603.mp4?t=1754583205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/62b557cfae7569a129ecaae3aea4d66f.avif?t=1754583205\" width=352 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No two runs play the same.</strong><br>Pick up a wild arsenal of active skills and passive upgrades - then create deadly combos on the fly. Will you be a glass cannon dashing into chaos, or a master of control who kites enemies into traps?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/90fd8b6ad55a087e0903f88fe2021e71.poster.avif?t=1754583205\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/90fd8b6ad55a087e0903f88fe2021e71.webm?t=1754583205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/90fd8b6ad55a087e0903f88fe2021e71.mp4?t=1754583205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/975ad4390ef4af4850e66e793544251d.avif?t=1754583205\" width=342 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This isn\u2019t just another auto-attacker. Your aim, timing and movement matters.</strong>  <br>Dodge through waves of enemies, chain skills with perfect precision and turn tight fights into stylish victories. The deeper you go, the faster and meaner everything gets - and only the most skilled make it to the end.<strong>  </strong>  <br>If you love games that reward fast thinking and tighter execution, you\u2019ll feel right at home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/259f59851f1a42f0dddc3b0aed33d616.poster.avif?t=1754583205\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/259f59851f1a42f0dddc3b0aed33d616.webm?t=1754583205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/259f59851f1a42f0dddc3b0aed33d616.mp4?t=1754583205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/fcb370cd5c15715249eb46f81ad9e6c5.avif?t=1754583205\" width=342 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every room is built with intention!</strong><br>We've designed more than 40 unique room layouts packed with traps, enemy ambushes and unexpected challenges. On each run, you'll face a fresh mix of these handcrafted encounters, keeping you on your toes without sacrificing flow or balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/2778bbf4fe17ea85ed0e34a9e8025019.poster.avif?t=1754583205\" width=60